; woods_root_caves.room - earth and stone caves under woods_deep (design 04 section 3.4; design 02 section 8).
; Drop in through the hole into the earth well (Espacial 2: roots climb rows 1-5 to the one-way at row 0, cols 28-29, and one
; jump from it reaches woods_deep; bugs/the-root-caves-roots-end-short-of-woods-deep-without-the-row-0-ledge). Logico 1: shaft D
; (stone|earth, cols 39-41) never roots, shaft A (earth|earth, cols 50-52) does. Espacial 1: from the bottom of D, west
; through the corner (col 26) to the root bridge (row 17) and the alcove (cols 1-7, rows 9-16), the planned STORY-06
; collectible slot (col 3, standing on row 17); return by the tunnel (rows 19-20) to A and up its roots.

[room]
origin = 0, 0
tileset = spring_woods

